# Rendered into a ConfigMap by `pilot up`. Only CONNECT to 443 on allowlisted hosts.
Port 8888
Listen 0.0.0.0
Timeout 600
MaxClients 20
LogLevel Connect
Syslog Off
DisableViaHeader Yes
ConnectPort 443
Filter "/etc/pilot-proxy/allowlist"
FilterType ere
FilterURLs Off
FilterDefaultDeny Yes
FilterCaseSensitive Off
